0..36 Comment "//! This source shows shared access."
37..40 Comment "//!"
41..100 Comment "//! A shared access lends a held value to a read-only view."
101..145 Comment "//! The body can read the view and the hold."
146..149 Comment "//!"
150..182 Comment "//! The view ends with its body."
183..253 Comment "//! It writes nothing back and takes no `resume`, `abort` or `unwind`."
254..320 Comment "//! The checker blocks an exclusive access until shared views end."
